  "description": "Clean Architecture template — Infrastructure.Persistence.Mongo leaf package: MongoDB.EntityFrameworkCore provider integration (MongoDbContext base, AddAppMongoDbContext registration with the Mongo interceptor stack incl. soft-delete, IMongoDbAccessor escape hatch, BSON conventions, health check). Opt-in — reference only when the service uses MongoDB, so the base package stays free of the Mongo EF provider. Numeronym `C15e` = CleanArchitecture. Generation 2026 series. See docs/plans/persistence-provider-level-split-analysis.md.",
